{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03006","headline":"出爲豫章郡途次庐山东岩下 · 张九龄","name":"出爲豫章郡途次庐山东岩下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹山镇何所，乃在澄湖阴。\n下有蛟螭伏，上与虹蜺寻。\n灵仙未始旷，窟宅何其深。\n双阙出云峙，三宫入烟沈。\n攀崖犹昔境，种杏非旧林。\n想像终古迹，惆怅独往心。\n纷吾婴世网，数载忝朝簪。\n孤根自靡托，量力况不任。\n多谢周身防，常恐横议侵。\n岂匪鵷鸿列，惕如泉壑临。\n迨兹刺江郡，来此涤尘襟。\n有趣逢樵客，忘怀狎野禽。\n栖闲义未果，用拙欢在今。\n愿言答休命，归事丘中琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}